      "type": "equation",
      "content": "k! \\mathbb{P}(X=k) \\stackrel{\\text{тв}}{=} g_X^{(k)}(0) = \\left. \\frac{d^k}{ds^k} \\frac{p^r}{(1-qs)^r} \\right|_{s=0}"
    },
    {
      "type": "equation",
      "content": "= p^r \\left. \\frac{d^k}{ds^k} \\frac{1}{(1-qs)^r} \\right|_{s=0} = p^r \\cdot r(r+1) \\dots (r+k-1)"
